title: The Binding Ritual
portrait left: seeker
portrait right: archivist

archivist: I need cards for a ritual, do you have any to spare?
seeker: Just cards?
archvist: Well, cards... and it may hurt a bit.

choice:
  - Remove a card, take 8 damage -> one
  - [if hp > 20] Remove two cards, take 16 damage -> two
  - Leave -> leave

@one
  > hp -8
  > card remove choose 1
  archivist: One step closer to my goals...
  > end

@two
  > hp -16
  > card remove choose 2
  archivist: A generous gift!
  > end

@leave
  archivist: Understandable. 
  > end
